    ('4uC16DfJePiYY28BRYLeU5Mn5GX43YUJXgyNdv6eT3No', 'XSCM46HqeDf3kA9ti3aJFL4RWyyrGnNXePap9GXip3d', 440108721, 0, DECIMAL '716452552671468', DECIMAL '6992729530'),
